  "description": "SC8 pH re-standardisation (experiment 2, spec sections 6.2 and 7): the default scenario with feedback on and the pH probe model of A094, A095, A051 and A108. The online probe reads true pH plus an offset that drifts and is readjusted onto an offline value every 24 h (A108); the controller acts on the reading with its deadband, so the true pH moves when the probe is off. A pH sample is taken in a closed container unless a technique error (A064, the value of the experienced profile) leaves it open. Run only by the closed-loop assembly (the plain run refuses feedback); a model-internal comparison under these assumptions, not a prediction.",
